        <h2 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-ink);margin-bottom:12px;">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.7;">By accessing and using MeetSpot, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our service.</p>

        <h2 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-ink);margin-bottom:12px;">2. Use of Service</h2>
