        <h2 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-ink);margin-bottom:12px;">3. Booking Policy</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.7;">All bookings are subject to availability. Regular users must book at least 5 days in advance. Premium and Corporate users may book same-day. Working hours are 8:00 AM to 6:00 PM.</p>

        <h2 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-ink);margin-bottom:12px;">4. Cancellation Policy</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.7;">Cancellation fees apply based on account type. Regular users: 50% fee if cancelled less than 4 hours before. Premium users: 25% fee if cancelled less than 2 hours before. Corporate users: no cancellation fee.</p>

        <h2 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-ink);margin-bottom:12px;">5. Account Termination</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.7;">MeetSpot reserves the right to terminate accounts that violate these terms or engage in fraudulent activity.</p>

        <h2 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-ink);margin-bottom:12px;">6. Changes to Terms</h2>
